==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Gabriel]]s (400%) spawn after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>, delay 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.
*1 [[Heavenly Hippoe]] spawns after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Gabriel]] (10%) spawns as the boss.
**1 [[Chickful A]] spawns after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.
**2 [[Winged Pigge]]s spawn, delay 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>.
**1 [[Cala Maria]] spawns.
**5 [[Gabriel]]s (400%) spawn, delay 20 seconds<sup>600f</sup>.

==Strategy==
[[Rocker Cat (Rare Cat)|Ramen Cat]] is one of the best choices here, being able to be used in both [[An Elder Secret (Merciless)|An Elder Secret]]  and this stage.

